5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,It is a pleasure to see you all. Perhaps we should look at the administrative records to ensure our choice is truly sustainable?,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"I agree. Scientific merit is one thing, but the practical ability to execute the work is where most projects fail.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Victoria,,"We must consider the shared infrastructure. If the facilities are over capacity, the most brilliant proposal will simply stall.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,Quite right. I am also curious about the actual purchasing power of the grant these days. The numbers on paper can be deceptive.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Midori,,I worry about the hidden interruptions. It would be wise to see where previous projects have lost time unexpectedly.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Shizue,,I shall look into the closeout files of finished awards and the portfolio review of schedule overruns to see what actually delivers.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,I will check the staffing rolls for technical posts and the minutes on secondments and crew strength.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Victoria,,I'll examine the accreditation and bookings at shared facilities and the incident logs on shared instrumentation.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,I will investigate the travel and bench-fee lines in the ledgers and the national computing agreement and facility day rates.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Midori,,I'll take the station records from partner field sites and the national repository deposit turnaround.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
